# Generated-project rules

Use `just` as the repository command contract. Run `just check` for fast
quality gates and `just qualify` before release work. Do not add lazyjust,
Neovim, or Mason tools to Python dependency groups: they are optional
workstation integrations.

Commit `uv.lock`. Run `just test-clean-locked` before offline artifact checks.
Update package versions only through `just version <new>`.
The project-local `.lazy.lua` exposes commands but does not define policy.
